# Celo Payments

- Tag every user-facing tx with `toDataSuffix(CELO_ATTRIBUTION_TAG)`; call `verifyTx` after settle.
- EIP-3009 for gasless authorisers; fee abstraction (`feeCurrency`) for agent gas in stablecoin.
- x402: talk to `api.x402.celo.org` only; gate USA₮ on live `GET /supported`.
- Token addresses must match `FACT_CHECK.md` verified rows — fail closed if unset.
- Private keys / X402 keys: server-only. Never ship to the browser.
